        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9165, Solid Brass Ball Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned to enhance any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired this solid brass, Omnia made, Ball Cabinet Knob is both modern and timeless. What is best about this knob is that it will never go out of style--a contemporary classic, it will look beautiful for years, no matter how many times you change the room's decor around it. The Modern Ball Cabinet Knob is available in 3 sizes and many modern finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Ball Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9165/25</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9165/30</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9165/35</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
